OL,3,GNEWSAApple Day called off after poor
OL,4,Aharvest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTatton Park's annual Apple Day has been
OL,7,Fcancelled for the first time in 24
OL,8,Fyears after extreme weather and
OL,9,Fincreased pest activity left organisers
OL,10,Fshort of fruit to share with visitors.
OL,12,FThe event in Cheshire will not take
OL,13,Fplace this October following a
OL,14,Fsignificantly reduced harvest from the
OL,15,Festate's collection of about 300 apple
OL,16,Fand pear trees.
OL,18,FHead gardener Simon Tetlow said
OL,19,Fprolonged summer drought had created
OL,20,Fone of the most challenging growing
OL,21,Fseasons the team had experienced.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
